<title>SWEDEN: TABLE-Saab Auto posts H1 loss.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Saab Auto posts H1 loss.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish car maker Saab Auto released its results for the first six months of 1997 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>					(million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss				  600 vs    428</p>
<p> Sales					10,975 vs 10,132</p>
<p> Operating loss				394 vs     95</p>
<p> Operating margin (pct)		   -3.3 vs   -0.9</p>
<p> Net loss					634 vs    456</p>
<p>NOTE -- Saab Automobile AB is jointly owned by U.S. auto group General Motors and Swedish investment group Investor AB.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
